-- 4. Abutment — the old block is underpinned; new mass is keyed in behind it.
-- ~40 cycles (~102 s at 94 BPM).

glideBpm 94 16
d2 brush
d3 $ stack [ride, rideBell]
xfadeIn 5 24 colourAbut
-- light swing
d6 $ bassAbut # amp 0.5
xfadeIn 4 16 compAbut

-- the reed enters properly
xfadeIn 7 24 reedAbut

-- the reed has loop 1 already but doesn't seem to stop
xfadeIn 7 24 silence

-- the new mass: wood, metal and site air
xfadeIn 9 16 $ degradeBy 0.4 (stack [woodTick, metalTool])
xfadeIn 10 32 $ stack [air, gravel]
